      "text": "brother of Jared2 talked with the Lord face to face, D&C 17:1 (50:11). without priesthood no man can see face of the Father and live, D&C 84:22. Moses sought to sanctify his people, that they might behold face of God, D&C 84:23. face of the Lord shall be unveiled, D&C 88:68, 95 (124:8). obedient shall see the Lord’s face, D&C 93:1. seek face of the Lord always, D&C 101:38. Enoch2 was before the Lord’s face continually, D&C 107:49. in day of visitation the Lord will unveil face of his covering, D&C 124:8. Joseph Smith to see the Lord’s face, D&C 130:15–16. sun shall hide face in shame, D&C 133:49. spirits of rebellious did not look on the Savior’s face, D&C 138:21.",
